# The bundle's apt set = RootfsProvisioner.BROWSER_PACKAGES + WineProvisioner.WINE_PACKAGES.
# RuntimeTest cross-pins this file against both Kotlin lists: a package added or
# renamed there (the t64 lesson) fails the build-apk suite until this file follows.
# One name per line; '#' starts a comment. Distro-resolved versions, by design -
# the bundle's own SHA-256 is the fail-closed pin, and the exact installed
# versions are recorded in the bundle's provenance manifest.

# --- the browser's GTK3/X11/font/CA stack (BROWSER_PACKAGES) ---
libgtk-3-0t64
libdbus-glib-1-2
libdbus-1-3
libasound2t64
libxt6t64
libx11-xcb1
libegl1
libgl1
x11-apps
x11-utils
libgtk-3-bin
openbox
fontconfig
fonts-dejavu-core
fonts-liberation
ca-certificates
dbus
dbus-x11

# --- the Wine payload (WINE_PACKAGES; apt resolves libwine as a hard dep) ---
wine64
wine
